{"title":"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Difference_of_Squares)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Difference of Squares)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡️3_min_solution⚡️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡️3 min solution⚡️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical(Easy_to_understand_🧠)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy to understand 🧠)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b98ba1a14efdf1cd888a6ae5f0d2de102e6d88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\left(1+\\frac13\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{5^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{7^2}\\right)}}?\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"59\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/4/f24ed810cd44502edcc9391e795e93fb34fd0c6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sqrt3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\sqrt{15} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{105}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Difference_of_Squares.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Difference_of_Squares)\">Solution 1 (Difference of Squares)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Difference of Squares)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We apply the difference of squares to the denominator, and then regroup factors:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6863d8ab5cdbce12ec98b6dc491e169e2782da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{\\left(1+\\frac13\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{5^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{7^2}\\right)}} &amp;= \\frac{\\left(1+\\frac13\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\left(1+\\frac13\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)\\left(1-\\frac17\\right)}} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{\\left(1+\\frac13\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)\\left(1-\\frac17\\right)}} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac43\\cdot\\frac65\\cdot\\frac87}}{\\sqrt{\\frac23\\cdot\\frac45\\cdot\\frac67}} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}}{\\sqrt{2\\cdot4\\cdot6}} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt8}{\\sqrt2} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"656\" height=\"352\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 2 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since these numbers are fairly small, we can use brute force as follows: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bc609e60a9cfcb9d50c370e13198b7c9ae3a088.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(1+\\frac{1}{3})(1+\\frac{1}{5})(1+\\frac{1}{7})}{\\sqrt{(1-\\frac{1}{3^2})(1-\\frac{1}{5^2})(1-\\frac{1}{7^2})}} =\\frac{\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot\\frac{6}{5}\\cdot\\frac{8}{7}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{8}{9}\\cdot\\frac{24}{25}\\cdot\\frac{48}{49}}} =\\frac{\\frac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{(2^3)(2^3\\cdot3^1)(2^4\\cdot3^1)}{(3^2)(5^2)(7^2)}}} =\\frac{\\frac{64}{35}}{\\frac{96}{105}}=\\frac{64}{35}\\cdot\\frac{105}{96}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2}.\\]\" width=\"696\" height=\"59\" />\n~not_slay\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This solution starts precisely like the one above. We simplify to get the following:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27a39e17394ca808a8f128d3a64376ff4f6d7e06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(1+\\frac{1}{3})(1+\\frac{1}{5})(1+\\frac{1}{7})}{\\sqrt{(1-\\frac{1}{3^2})(1-\\frac{1}{5^2})(1-\\frac{1}{7^2})}} = \\frac{\\frac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{(2^3)(2^3\\cdot3^1)(2^4\\cdot3^1)}{(3^2)(5^2)(7^2)}}}\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"59\" />\n</p><p>But now, we can get a nice simplification as shown: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b90fdafc0f990819d834b40155c5a312336f31f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{(2^3)(2^3\\cdot3^1)(2^4\\cdot3^1)}{(3^2)(5^2)(7^2)}}} = \\dfrac{\\frac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{2^{10} \\cdot 3^{2}}{3^2\\cdot 5^2\\cdot 7^2}}} = \\dfrac{\\frac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7}}{\\frac{2^5 \\cdot 3}{3\\cdot5\\cdot 7}}  =\\dfrac{4\\cdot6\\cdot8}{3\\cdot5\\cdot7} \\hspace{0.05 in} \\cdot \\hspace{0.05 in}\\dfrac{3\\cdot5\\cdot 7}{2^5 \\cdot 3}  =\\dfrac{2^6\\cdot 3}{2^5\\cdot 3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2}.\\]\" width=\"590\" height=\"59\" />\n</p><p>~TaeKim\n</p><p>~minor edits by mathboy100\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F3_min_solution.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡️3_min_solution⚡️)\">Video Solution (⚡️3 min solution⚡️)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡️3 min solution⚡️)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/N7hGuy0MWOQ\">https://youtu.be/N7hGuy0MWOQ</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI?t=470\">https://youtu.be/_KNR0JV5rdI?t=470</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical.28Easy_to_understand_.F0.9F.A7.A0.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Ani_lytical(Easy_to_understand_🧠)\">Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy to understand 🧠)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Ani_lytical(Easy to understand 🧠)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fpPxIoy0Pc8?si=vI_OcytohaaXLUBg\">https://youtu.be/fpPxIoy0Pc8?si=vI_OcytohaaXLUBg</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1